<title>USA: Santa Cruz Cty RA, Calif., won by Stone &amp; Youngbrg.</title>
<headline>Santa Cruz Cty RA, Calif., won by Stone &amp; Youngbrg.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-12-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Stone &amp; Youngberg, said it won $10.175 million of Santa Cruz Cty Redevelopment Agency, Calif., 1996 subordinate tax allocation bonds, with a true interest cost of 5.61 percent.</p>
</text>
